      m_Calls: []
  m_text: HASHING is the core of blockchain security. It takes any data (name, amount,
    etc.) and turns it into a unique, fixed-length code (the HASH).  If you change
    ANY part of the original data, the resulting hash code changes COMPLETELY. This
    makes it impossible to tamper with a block without instantly breaking the chain's
    security.
